{"data": [{"author_id": "1748602031248732160", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:58:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120320165858689137"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/LhrlCFRPQL", "end": 178, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/_zheergen/status/2120320165858689137/video/1", "media_key": "13_2120318188273700864", "start": 155, "url": "https://t.co/LhrlCFRPQL"}, {"display_url": "x.com/_zheergen/stat…", "end": 202, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/_zheergen/status/2120165685800419758", "start": 179, "url": "https://t.co/kAsDsXY14C"}]}, "id": "2120320165858689137", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 204, "impression_count": 26259, "like_count": 177, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 31}, "text": "有意思！现在连缠论、龙头战法、情绪周期，都能直接让 AI 帮你分析了？\n\n71 个金融工具 + 21 个 AI Skills，从全市场选股、资金流分析到策略回测，直接整合成一套！\n\n开源项目 Stock Analysis Plugin，覆盖 A 股、港股、美股、日股、韩股、台股 6 大市场。\n\n以前用 AI https://t.co/LhrlCFRPQL https://t.co/kAsDsXY14C", "url": "https://x.com/_zheergen/status/2120320165858689137"}, {"author_id": "1904356601479548928", "created_at": "2026-11-11T02:21:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120341199206932653"], "id": "2120341199206932653", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 994, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "有人说只要爱在两人心中就不需要承诺，这话其实经不起推敲。爱本身就是承诺。情侣之间的承诺是短暂的，夫妻之间的承诺是终身的。肌肤之亲会助长爱意，让人依赖，但想过了热恋期还能两不相欠，那是错的。爱到深处，爱情就像一张网，把两个人缠在一起，谁也走不开。", "url": "https://x.com/Nancy_Dufren/status/2120341199206932653"}, {"author_id": "1730126599058780160", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:56:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120319616195141963"], "id": "2120319616195141963", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "结婚五周年那天，计蕾加班到晚上十点才回家。\n推开门，餐桌上摆着四个菜一瓶红酒，菜早就凉透了，丈夫尹航坐在沙发上，电视开着却没声音。\n她站在门口愣了几秒，才想起今天是什么日子。\n她没有解释项目有多急、老板有多难缠，换了鞋走过去，第一句话就是：“对不起，是我忘了，不是因为忙。”", "url": "https://x.com/huapingone/status/2120319616195141963"}, {"author_id": "1730126599058780160", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:47:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120317483777392674"], "id": "2120317483777392674", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "结婚五周年那天，计蕾加班到晚上十点才回家。\n推开门，餐桌上摆着四个菜一瓶红酒，菜早就凉透了，丈夫尹航坐在沙发上，电视开着却没声音。\n她站在门口愣了几秒，才想起今天是什么日子。\n她没有解释项目有多急、老板有多难缠，换了鞋走过去，第一句话就是：“对不起，是我忘了，不是因为忙。”", "url": "https://x.com/huapingone/status/2120317483777392674"}, {"author_id": "3725964072", "created_at": "2026-11-10T21:03:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120261025505181761"], "id": "2120261025505181761", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 13, "impression_count": 8207, "like_count": 49, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "讲个暴论：看一个gay被鸡巴捅进去之后怎么叫、怎么扭、怎么夹，基本就能直接定级他到底有多贱、多浪、多欠操。\n\n青铜：", "url": "https://x.com/PSbassguide/status/2120261025505181761"}, {"author_id": "1134614241103581184", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:40:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120300692116299788"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/8Jp69H9YhF", "end": 164, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/huang3feng/status/2120300692116299788/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120300687489921024", "start": 141, "url": "https://t.co/8Jp69H9YhF"}]}, "id": "2120300692116299788", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 118, "impression_count": 54283, "like_count": 627, "quote_count": 10, "reply_count": 54, "retweet_count": 129}, "text": "照片中的人叫程真，1989年，她是北师大学生，绝食留守到最后。\n\n她说：6月3日晚，我请那个抱病出院也要陪我们绝食的十几岁同学，去北京饭店吃「最后的晚餐」，\n花的是父母留给我去加拿大读书的钱。没吃几口，枪声就响了。\n我冲出门时手被旋转门卡住，扯出来指骨发白，用布一缠，又往广场跑。 https://t.co/8Jp69H9YhF", "url": "https://x.com/huang3feng/status/2120300692116299788"}, {"article": {"title": "《影之刃零》小说｜第11章 一年前"}, "author_id": "1685548626192506880", "created_at": "2026-11-11T01:30:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120328154980159589"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/i/article/2120…", "end":